From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000057 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SST development <sst-development@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:47:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port Skyward Sword Together to SkyRecomp2.0.2

Preserve independent player networking, guarded world/reward recovery,
verified remote animation playback and Developer diagnostics on upstream2.0.2.
Keep low-memory single-job default and portable Windows compiler support.

---
